        {
          "text": "Tena itakuwa atakapokwisha BWANA, Mungu wako, kukuleta katika nchi aliyowaapia babu zako, Ibrahimu na Isaka na Yakobo, ya kuwa atakupa; miji mikubwa mizuri usiyoijenga wewe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
