          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwani BWANA, Mungu wako, aliye katikati yako ni Mungu mwenye wivu; isije ikawaka juu yako hasira ya BWANA, Mungu wako, akakuangamiza kutoka juu ya uso wa nchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.15",
